    "created_at": "2017-02-06T09:59:39Z",
    "updated_at": "2017-02-06T09:59:39Z",
    "body": "> Given that hgroup doesn't actually do anything in any browser or other user agent, other than act as a styling hook suggest (again) dropping it.\r\n\r\nI wouldn’t lose any sleep if we end up dropping it from the spec. Someday I may even raise a PR with a patch the actually removes it, and then we all take the hours (days, weeks…) that would be necessary to have a discussion about that. But in the mean time, this PR is just about making a (hopefully uncontroversial) correction to what’s already in the spec so that it’s slightly less confusing to readers.",
